          objective: 'Correctly guess or back the hidden number chosen by the banker and collect the resulting payout.',
          gameplay: 'The banker secretly commits to a number outcome using the Tehonbiki card set. Other players place their guesses or wagers against that concealed choice. The banker reveals the result, payouts are settled, and the banker role continues or rotates according to house rules.',
          keyRules: [
            'One banker plays against one or more guessing opponents.',
            'Rounds revolve around hidden number information rather than trick-taking.',
            'House rules determine stake ladders, reveal procedure, and banker rotation.',
            'Result resolution is immediate after the banker reveals the chosen outcome.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: 'Avoid predictable number habits when acting as banker.',
          intermediate: 'Watch how specific opponents cluster their guesses and vary your reveal rhythm to stay unreadable.',
